data: {"id": "94cd1fedc0ad4fd7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1452", "run_id": "94cd1fedc0ad4fd7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Topology 数据采集成功。以下是补证结果说明：\n\n**Topology 采集结果：**\n- **Pod UID**: `546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **Owner 层级**: Pod → ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c` → Deployment `workload`\n- **容器**: `app`\n- **覆盖**: `present`（4 条事实，无截断）\n\n之前的 `Connection closed` 是临时 MCP 连接问题，重新调用后成功获取到拓扑信息。该 Pod 当前调度在 node2 上，拥有完整的 Owner 链和容器归属，具备业务流量上下文基础。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789064899650, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

