data: {"id": "94cd1fedc0ad4fd7-final", "run_id": "94cd1fedc0ad4fd7", "seq": 1457, "ts_ms": 1789064917170, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh in namespace aiops-case-05 stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\" | 确认容器处于启动等待阶段，尚未运行。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus (kubelet) | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: failed to setup network for sandbox \"1861e3...\": plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): Multus: ... error in getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) | 记录 kubelet 创建 Pod 沙箱时的核心失败机制，直接指向 Multus 插件无法加载网络配置。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | multus | `NoNetworkFound`: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found (连续出现 46 次，跨度 3 分钟至 60 分钟) | 持续证实 Pod 请求的网络资源在指定命名空间中不存在，排除临时网络波动。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"): 1 | 从监控维度确认等待状态为持续性，无自愈迹象。 |\n\n**证据综合分析**：\nKubernetes 状态与 Multus 事件形成直接因果印证：容器因网络沙箱创建失败而卡在 `ContainerCreating`（证据 1、4）；底层原因确认为 `multus-cni-network` 插件在调用时，在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中查不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 对象（证据 2、3）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用不存在的网络定义 → Multus CNI 插件无法找到配置并失败 → kubelet 创建沙箱失败 → Pod 持续卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 依赖的 Multus 网络附件定义 `unavailable-network` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中缺失。\n\n**分析依据**：\n1. **K8s Event 证据 (NoNetworkFound, FailedCreatePodSandBox)**：明确且连续地指出了 Multus 插件在尝试解析 Pod 网络配置时，找不到指定的 `network-attachment-definitions` 对象，这是导致无法创建网络沙箱的直接原因。\n2. **K8s State 证据 (ContainerCreating)**：证实了 Pod 因上述网络插件失败而无法进入运行状态。\n\n综上，Pod 启动阻塞的根本原因是配置错误（引用了不存在的资源），而非集群网络故障或调度问题。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 6.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 352.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 352.4s (Evidence 345.0s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 381.063, "metrics": {"run_id": "94cd1fedc0ad4fd7", "mttr": {"value": "6.4m", "seconds": 381.0691647529602, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 381069.1647529602, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 72555.65142631531, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 330452.16488838196, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 308032.11665153503}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18621.817350387573, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 352381.53886795044, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10033.8134765625, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

